Reference Implementations
=========================

- NATTEN (https://github.com/SHI-Labs/NATTEN) - MIT license
  src/allin1_infer/models/neighborhood_attention.py reimplements the semantics of
  NATTEN 0.17.x's legacy functional API in plain PyTorch, verified against output
  recorded from NATTEN 0.17.5. NATTEN is not a dependency of this package.

